sequenceDiagram
  participant Author as Developer (git)
  participant Cat as contracts.js + payloads.js
  participant Start as start-all.js
  participant Prod as Producer e.g. MDM
  participant Cons as Consumer e.g. TAX
  participant Run as run-contracts.js
  participant Broker as Pact Broker
  participant CI as CI/CD gate

  Author->>Cat: Define CT-02 producer/consumer/path + PAYLOADS
  Note over Cat: Contract "generated"/stored in source
  Author->>Start: npm start (described only)
  Start->>Prod: listen :4102
  Start->>Cons: listen :4104
  Prod->>Prod: GET /contracts/ct-02/tax-attributes returns PAYLOADS
  Cons->>Prod: GET /consume/CT-02 (optional runtime pull)
  Author->>Run: npm run test:contracts (described only)
  Run->>Prod: fetch urlFor(MDM, path)
  Run->>Run: assert contractId + requiredKeys
  Run-->>Author: PASS or FAIL + exit code
  Broker-->>Author: Not found in repo
  CI-->>Author: Not found in repo
